================================================================================

Context: last task of incremental triple materialization. The build pipeline
now persists how each build materialized its triples, but nothing compared the
`_slots` streaming table with the `_data` relation, the feature had no guide,
the slot pipeline had no DAB-side documentation, and the build-run cockpit did
not show the materialization facts. Implemented by the controller after two
delegated attempts stopped on a stale plan-mode flag.

