   `g_<dom>_v<n>_live` DDL (PK (map_id, source_key, predicate), partial indexes WHERE
   NOT deleted, early autovacuum), the tombstone purge, the live-row count, and the
   union view as a distinct UNION of the synced table, the companion and the live
