controller's live spike (2026-11-02) settled the event shape: an AUTO CDC slot
flow carries `num_upserted_rows` / `num_deleted_rows` on exactly one RUNNING
`flow_progress` event and no `num_output_rows` (no double count), a changed
source row re-upserts every slot of that row, and a bootstrap reports the whole
table — hence the new `full_refresh` flag.

